WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:03,030
Two ducks

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,030
Late at night

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:06,030
Why did you come to your father's house? Aunt Song

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,030
My mother asked me to borrow needle and thread from you

5
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:10,030
She wants to help me mend my clothes

6
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,030
Late at night

7
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:12,030
The lights are not bright enough

8
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,030
What clothes to mend?

9
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,030
Gu Manman wouldn’t do it for

10
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,030
retaliation

11
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,030
Deliberately making Erya simply

12
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,030
Come at this time, right?

13
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:18,540
But dad

14
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,540
Erya only has one piece of clothing

15
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,540
If tonight

16
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,540
If it is not repaired

17
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:27,540
I won’t be able to go out tomorrow

18
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,540
only one piece of clothing

19
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:31,150
I've been reborn for a few days

20
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:32,150
The whole family has never changed clothes

21
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,150
At most, I just wash it at night.

22
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,150
Let it dry and wear it the next day

23
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,150
It’s just an adult

24
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:39,150
But the big duck and the second duck grow fast

25
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,570
Those pants are a lot too short

26
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,570
Let your mother mend your clothes tonight

27
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,570
Wait until dad comes back from the sea tomorrow

28
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:45,570
buy you new clothes

29
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,700
Mom said it’s only during the Chinese New Year

30
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,700
to buy new clothes

31
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,500
What your mother said is not a second-rate duck.

32
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Let's go. Auntie will get you some needle and thread.

33
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:00,710
Need to make money as soon as possible
